From 0c3ccc549cfd6703ee36461f38fee6f76c025d9c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 12:46:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD selected-agent slash command routing so backend
 commands bypass prompt sends

Slash-prefixed messages in a selected agent chat are backend commands instead of ordinary prompts. The provider trait has a default command hook for compatibility, Codex resumes with the slash command as a command argument, and controller title generation skips these command-only messages.
